{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14277","headline":"雪中遇直 · 窦羣","name":"雪中遇直","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒光凝雪彩，限直居粉闱。\n怳疑白云上，乍觉金印非。\n树色霭虚空，琴声谐素徽。\n明晨阻通籍，独卧挂朝衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"窦羣","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14277.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14277","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}